ems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2013 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017021550\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 299/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4458/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 405/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4069/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.429      1 -total\n 26.77%    7.610      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 25.28%    7.188      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 17.63%    5.012      1 Template:Duplicate\n 16.93%    4.814      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11806:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017021550 and revision id 290787. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}